Note on stickers / 关于表情包素材:

This repository contains NO sticker images. Users supply their own.
Sticker images placed in `stickers/` are excluded via .gitignore.
Any images you use remain subject to their own copyright — this MIT license
covers only the code in this repository.

本仓库不含任何表情包图片,由使用者自备。`stickers/` 已被 .gitignore 排除。
你所使用的图片受其自身版权约束,本 MIT 许可仅覆盖本仓库中的代码。
